' LEGACY: ResNet-50/ResNet-18 architecture (Phase 3).
' Superseded by prepare-doc-training-workflow-high-level.puml
' and prepare-doc-distillation.puml (SigLIP 2 + MobileNetV4).
@startuml prepare-doc-training-workflow-v2
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam activityBorderColor #333333
skinparam activityBackgroundColor #E8F4FD
skinparam arrowColor #333333

title Prepare-Doc - IQA Training Workflow v2 (Current Implementation)
footer Updated: 2025-12-16 | Phase 7 MVP Dataset

|#LightBlue|Data Preparation|
start
note right #FFCCCC
  WARNING: LEGACY DIAGRAM (Phase 3)
  ResNet-50/18 Teacher-Student Architecture
  SUPERSEDED by SigLIP 2 + MobileNetV4 pipeline.
  See: prepare-doc-training-workflow-high-level.puml
  and prepare-doc-distillation.puml
end note
:Collect from 16 sources\n(E: drive organized);
note right
  **01_base_data/** (Training)
  * degraded/: tobacco800, historical
  * documents/: rvl_cdip, doclaynet
  * forms/: nist_db2, nist_sd6, funsd+, sroie
  * tables/: tablebank, pubtabnet
  * handwriting/: nist_sd19, maths_handwriting
  * formulas/: mathverse
  * educational/: multimodal_textbook
  ----
  **02_benchmark_only/** (Eval)
  * diqa-5000 (human MOS)
  * dibco
end note

:consolidate_base_images.py\nSample 25K images (seed=42);
:generate_iqa_dataset.py\nResize to 384x384 (Lanczos);

:Apply augmentations\n(blur, noise, compression, lighting, geometric);

:Calculate severity labels\n[0.0, 0.95] per dimension;
:Calculate DQS score;
note right
  **DQS Formula:**
  page_deg = 0.4*blur + 0.3*noise + 0.3*contrast
  degradation = median(page_deg)
  complexity = max(layout_complexity)
end note

:create_phase7_splits.py\nStratified 70/15/15 split;
:create_phase7_tar_archives.py\nPackage + upload to GCS;

|#LightGreen|Teacher Training|
:Initialize ResNet-50\n(ImageNet pretrained);
:Add 5-head IQA classifier\n(blur, noise, compression, contrast, geometric);
note right
  **Architecture:**
  * Backbone: ResNet-50
  * Dropout: 0.3
  * Loss: Gaussian NLL
  * Input: 384x384
end note

:Train on GCS dataset\n(Modal GPU: T4/A10);
note right
  **Hyperparameters:**
  * Epochs: 100
  * Batch: 32
  * LR: 1e-4 (AdamW)
  * Weight Decay: 0.02
  * Warmup: 5 epochs
  * Seed: 42
end note

:Validate on held-out set;
if (Meets ECE and MAE targets?) then (yes)
  :Export Teacher checkpoint\n(val_loss=0.27);
else (no)
  :Tune hyperparameters;
  :Retrain (50 epochs);
endif

|#LightYellow|Knowledge Distillation|
:Initialize ResNet-18 Student\n(random weights);
:Run Teacher forward passes\n(collect soft targets + uncertainties);
:Train Student with KL + CE loss;
note right
  **Distillation Config:**
  * Temperature: T=4.0
  * Alpha (soft): 0.7
  * Beta (hard): 0.3
  * Epochs: 30
end note

if (Student ECE gap acceptable?) then (yes)
  :Export Student\n(val_loss=0.14);
else (no)
  :Adjust alpha, beta, T;
  :Retrain Student;
endif

:Export to ONNX\n(CPU inference);
:Export to TorchScript\n(GPU inference);

|#Lavender|Model Registry|
:Register in model registry\n(version, metrics, lineage);
:Deploy Student as default;
:Keep Teacher for selective inference;

|#LightGray|Production Inference|
:Document ingestion;
if (High uncertainty or discrepancy?) then (yes)
  :Invoke Teacher\n(selective inference);
else (no)
  :Use Student only\n(fast path);
endif
:Return IQA scores + DQS;
stop

legend right
  |= Component |= Status |= Metric |
  | Dataset (25K) | DONE | 858 MB |
  | Teacher (ResNet-50) | DONE | val_loss=0.27 |
  | Student (ResNet-18) | DONE | val_loss=0.14 |
  | ONNX Export | DONE | - |
  | TorchScript Export | DONE | - |
  | Model Registry | DONE | - |
endlegend

note right
  **Source:**
  - modal/train_siglip2_iqa.py (legacy Phase 3 predecessor)
  - modal/train_siglip2_iqa_v2.py (IQA-only train script)
  - modal/shared/metrics_utils.py
  - modal/shared/gcs_utils.py

  **Scripts:**
  - scripts/prepare_multitask_datasets.py

