  [[docs/architecture/diagrams/level-2/model-training/prepare-doc-training-workflow-high-level.puml]]
  [[docs/planning/SIGLIP2_MULTITASK_REQUIREMENTS.md]]
  [[docs/architecture/diagrams/level-2/model-training/index.md]]

  **ADR:**
  [[docs/ADRs/0028-resnet-teacher-student-architecture.md]]
  [[docs/ADRs/0035-modal-gpu-integration.md]]
  [[docs/ADRs/0030-gcs-colab-training-workflow.md]]

  **SUPERSEDED BY:**
  prepare-doc-training-workflow-high-level.puml
  prepare-doc-distillation.puml
end note

@enduml
